    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eibelekenya Hesekia orrekie le sayiata e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa pee eidipayu nena pooki, ore lelo Siraeli pooki apa ootii ine, neipang aapuo nkanas e Yuda nebel aaitaa mbelibelat ing'apeta neuroki Asherim enkop, nesulaa iwuejitin neeika, o lperereni loo lasarri te Yuda pooki, o te Benchamen, o te Efraim o te Manase, ometaba anaa neidaikie pooki. Neitoki iltung'ana pooki le Israel aarrinyo aapuo nkanas enye, nelo ake oltung'ani ewueji enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negelu Hesekia ntukusi oo lapolosak o noo Lawi. Entukus ake o enkae tukus, negelu ake entukus te risioroto esiaai enye, ilapolosak o Lawi tenkaraki ilasarri oopejori o lasarri le seriani. Pee eisiaaisho too nchomito oo lng'oborri lo Laitoriani neishooyo enashe o enkisisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Enki 28.1–29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore apa enkishorunoto o laiguanani naing'uaa imasaa enyena makewan, naa tenkaraki ilasarri oopejori. Ilasarri oopejori le tadekenya o le nteipa. O lasarri oopejori le sabato, o lapaitin ng'ejuko, o siruai oogeluno, anaa enaigeroki tiatua enkitanapata o Laitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.12+NUM.18.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 18.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitanap ninye lelo tung'ana apa oomanya Yerusalem, pee eishooyo erubata oo lapolosak o Lawi, pee etum ninche aaishoo ate enkitanapata o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake ina kata pee eitubulari ina kitanapata, neishooyo iltung'ana le Israel te nkumoi, ilng'anayio lenye le dukuya le ntapa, o enaisho oo sabibu, o eilata, o enaisho oo lotorok o ntokitin pooki naanotoki te nkurma. Neyau ninche te leng'on erubata e tomon e pooki toki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana le Israel o le Yuda ootii nkanas e Yuda neyau sii ninche erubata e tomon oo nkishu o nkerra, o ntokitin apa naaitisinyaki neiteng'elakini Olaitoriani Enkai enye, neirragieki ninche aasot too lturrurri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lapa liokuni neiteru ninche aaiturrur lelo sotot neidip to lapa liopishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee elotu Hesekia o lkituaak aadol lelo sotot, neisis Olaitoriani nemayian iltung'ana lenyena le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neikilikuanishore Hesekia ilapolosak o Lawi tenkaraki lelo sotot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki ninye Asaria ilo apolosani kitok le nkaji e Sadok, nejoki, “Ore anaa neiteru ninche aayau nkishorot atua enkaji o Laitoriani kitadaate iyiook, nikiraposho nikileku nkumok. Amu etamayiana Olaitoriani iltung'ana lenyena, neaku kinoto iyiook ele shumati pooki otelekua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Hesekia aitanap ninche meitobira ilgilat tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani, neitobir ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ninche nena kishorot, o ematua e tomon, o nena tokitin naaitisinyaki. Ore olaitasheikinoni kitok naa Konania olayioni le Lawi, tenebo Shimei olalashe lenye, aa ninye oliare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa Yehiel apa, o Asasia, o Natan, o Asahel, o Yerimot, o Yosabad, o Elieli, o Ismakia, o Mahat, o Benaia, ninche ilaitasheikinok ooretu Konania o Shimei olalashe lenye. Ninche etegelua olaiguanani Hesekia o Asaria ilo kitok oitasheiki enkaji e Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa Kore olayioni le Imna, le Lawi, ninye olarriponi le nkishomi enkalo oloo saen, ninye oitasheiki nkishorot o lpela naaishori Enkai. Pee eiteng'el nkishorot naaiteng'elakaki Olaitoriani o nena kishorot naasinya oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa Eden, o Miniamin, o Yoshua ninche apa ootonyuaa aaretu ninche te nena anas oo lapolosak, pee eorioriki ilalashera lenye irubat enye, ilbotoro o looti, aaitorisioki, too ntukusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meteleku ake lelo ooigeroki anaa ilmareita, ilewa ebaiki ilarin okuni neilep. Lelo pooki oojing'u atua enkaji o Laitoriani, anaa enayieuni te pooki olong, te nkisiayiare enye terisioroto oo siaaitin enye, too lturrurri lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa enkigeroto oo lapolosak naa te risioroto oo nkajijik oo loo menye. Aa taa Ilawi ooitabaya ilarin tikitam o imiet neilep naa te risioroto oo siaaitin enye too lturrurri lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa ilapolosak neigeroki tenebo nkera enye pooki, o nkituaak enye o layiok lenye, o ntoyie enye, o eumata pooki. Amu keisiligayu apa ninche egolie ate aaitaa sinyat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Aron, lelo apolosak, lelo apa ootii enkop namanya pooki ng'ae, o nkanas enye netii iltung'ana ootii atua kulie anas ootegelakaki too nkarn, pee eoriki irubat pooki lee tiatua ilapolosak, o pooki tung'ani tiatua Ilawi apa ooigeroki enkarna enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas Hesekia ina tiatua Yuda pooki, neas ninye mbaa sidain naaishiaakino te dukuya Olaitoriani Enkai enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki siaai nataasa ninye te nkisiayiare e nkaji e Nkai, o te risioroto e nkitanapata eing'orua Enkai enye, neas ninye ina to ltau lenye pooki. Nebul ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
